{"id":"en_my-wolf-rejected-me-so-i-chose-the-scarred-fox","title":"My Wolf Rejected Me, So I Chose the Scarred Fox","titleEn":"My Wolf Rejected Me, So I Chose the Scarred Fox","description":"For thirteen years, Emma devoted herself to the wolf she had saved from the black market. Then she overheard Brian confess that he had always wished he belonged to her beautiful cousin instead. Having spent a lifetime being mocked for her appearance and never being anyone's first choice, Emma severed their bond, handed him her home, and moved to Miami to begin again as a university lecturer. There she encounters Finn, a scarred fox Beastkin who was abandoned after fleeing a trafficking ring. Emma offers him the kindness she had once longed for, and in return he gives her what Brian never did: unwavering devotion and the strength to recognize her own value. When Brian reappears asking for a second chance, Emma faces a choice between the love that hurt her and the one that at last feels like","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-wolf-rejected-me-so-i-chose-the-scarred-fox/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-wolf-rejected-me-so-i-chose-the-scarred-fox/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fated Lovers","Werewolf","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du1c6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-wolf-rejected-me-so-i-chose-the-scarred-fox_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du1c6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-wolf-rejected-me-so-i-chose-the-scarred-fox_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du1c6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"